WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.825
Language: the interface speaks eight languages. Open the Language menu.

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:17.758
The whole window changes at once; the choice is remembered.

00:00:17.858 --> 00:00:28.654
Help ▸ About shows the version and credits.

00:00:28.754 --> 00:00:39.548
File ▸ Optional modules… checks which extra tools are installed; none is required, the OCR engine is built in.

00:00:39.648 --> 00:00:50.377
Undo and Redo also work from the keyboard: Ctrl+Z and Ctrl+Y.

00:00:50.477 --> 00:00:55.315
Files can also be dropped into the window from a file manager, and the program can be started with files on its command line.
